"LaCuO3 (CuLaO3 hp rhom) Crystal Structure" 
taken from SpringerMaterials (sm_isp_sd_1232613).
;

_publ_section_references
;Weigl C., Range K.J.: <i>Rhombohedral LaCuO<sub>3</sub>: High-pressure synthesis of single crystals and structure refinement</i>. Journal of Alloys and Compounds <b>200</b> (1993) L1-L2.
;

#Phase classification
_sm_phase_labels				'CuLaO3 hp rhom'
_chemical_name_mineral			''
_sm_chemical_compound_class		'oxide'
_sm_phase_prototype				'LaAlO3 '
_sm_pearson_symbol				'hR30'
_symmetry_Int_Tables_number		167
_sm_sample_details
;sample prepared from CuO, La<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>, 
energy-dispersive X-ray analysis; La/Cu ratio 1/1, 
single crystal (determination of cell parameters), 
single crystal, 0.007&#x00d7;0.007&#x00d7;0.030 mm<sup>3</sup> (determination of structural parameters)
;
_sm_measurement_details
;automatic diffractometer (determination of cell parameters), 
automatic diffractometer; Enraf-Nonius CAD4 (determination of structural parameters), 
X-rays, Mo K&#x03b1;; &#x03bb; = 0.071069 nm (determination of cell and structural parameters)
;
_sm_interpretation_details
;complete structure determined, 
least-squares refinement; 10 variables; 175 reflections, 
<i>R</i> = 0.037; <i>wR</i> = 0.020
;

